    "who": "leon",
    "message": "- **Taberna Sal Grosso** (Alfama) — tiny, book ahead; grilled vegetables and great petiscos.\n- **O Pitéu da Graça** — classic tasca, cheap and loud; ask for the *migas* without meat.\n- **Ao 26 – Vegan Food Project** (Chiado, 15 min walk) — fully vegan, very good.\n- **Prado** — the nicer dinner: seasonal, lots of vegetables, natural wine. Reserve ~2 weeks ahead.\n\nI added these to the itinerary notes for 13 and 14 March.",
